          "quote": "波立维就是氯吡格雷"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00742",
          "explanation": "The doctor explained why the old Plavix box must not be added on top of the discharge clopidogrel.",
          "quote": "不要再单独加一盒"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by the caregiver's Plavix/clopidogrel confusion. The doctor repeatedly corrected the misconception, explained duplication risk and DAPT in caregiver-executable language, and obtained repeated family confirmation that old medicines would remain sealed and verified.",
