          "explanation": "The doctor prevented false reassurance from the 'not going to cath lab now' statement.",
          "quote": "不等于\"心梗排除了\""
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by ambiguous clinician statements about MI, cath lab timing, and stability. The doctor repeatedly explained what could and could not be concluded, tied verification to troponin/ECG/kidney/cardiology review, and connected uncertainty to red-flag escalation.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
