          "explanation": "The doctor distilled the night-shift caregiver's role into concrete executable tasks.",
          "quote": "替班家属的任务只有三条"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by caregiver fatigue and rotating family coverage. The doctor produced practical shift cards, nurse/doctor question lists, photo/record workflows, and specific red-flag escalation instructions with meaningful trajectory impact.",
