          "explanation": "The doctor framed the case as a high-risk acute cardiovascular transition, not a routine medication question.",
          "quote": "急性心衰或心肌缺血等高危情况"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met: the doctor prioritized possible ACS plus heart-failure decompensation in a post-stent patient and did not treat cardiology transfer or clearer consciousness as proof of safety.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
