      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 was met: the doctor repeatedly incorporated kidney dysfunction, diabetes, hypertension, electrolyte status, bleeding/anemia, and pulmonary/heart-failure monitoring into the safety boundaries without inventing definitive values.",
